{"type":"frame-snapshot","snapshot":{"callId":"call@1776","snapshotName":"after@call@1776","pageId":"page@9a9c8066cef4eb34886e4a1910924870","frameId":"frame@1f5ddcd3b97027bd930e9564246967fa","frameUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:7483/#/dettaglio-paziente/QA-418-INDEPENDENT/parametri","doctype":"html","html":["HTML",{"lang":"it"},["HEAD",{},[[20,0]],[[20,1]],[[20,2]],[[20,3]],[[20,4]],[[20,5]],[[20,6]],[[20,7]],[[20,8]],[[20,9]],[[20,10]],[[20,11]],[[20,12]],[[20,13]],[[20,15]],[[20,16]],[[20,18]],[[20,20]],[[20,22]],[[20,24]],[[20,26]],[[20,28]],[[15,1]],[[15,3]],[[15,5]],[[15,7]],[[15,9]],[[15,11]],[[15,13]],[[15,15]],[[15,17]],[[15,19]],[[15,21]],[[15,23]],[[15,25]],[[15,27]],[[15,29]],[[15,31]],[[15,33]],[[15,35]],[[15,37]],[[15,39]],[[15,41]],[[15,43]],[[15,45]],[[15,47]],[[15,49]],[[15,51]],[[15,53]],[[15,55]],[[15,57]],[[15,59]],[[15,61]],[[15,63]],[[15,65]],[[15,67]],[[15,69]],[[8,1]],[[8,3]],[[8,5]],[[8,7]],[[8,9]],[[8,11]],[[8,13]],[[8,15]],[[8,17]],[[8,19]],[[8,21]],[[5,1]],["STYLE",{},"/* Ricerca in anagrafica AIFA. Token del design system; nessun rosso come colore di marca. */\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n  padding: 16px 20px 20px;\r\n  min-height: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__campo {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 8px;\r\n  padding: 8px 12px;\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 10px;\r\n  background: #fff;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Stesso vincolo del campo nella maschera terapia: senza, il flex stira l'icona a tutto campo. */\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__campo > svg {\r\n  flex: none;\r\n  width: 18px;\r\n  height: 18px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__campo:focus-within {\r\n  border-color: var(--blue);\r\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgb(47 107 237 / 12%);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__campo input {\r\n  flex: 1;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  border: 0;\r\n  outline: none;\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  background: transparent;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__criterio {\r\n  width: fit-content;\r\n  max-width: 100%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__esiti {\r\n  flex: 1;\r\n  min-height: 0;\r\n  overflow: auto;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__nota {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__nota--errore {\r\n  color: var(--red);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__lista {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  list-style: none;\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: 8px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__riga {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: space-between;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n  padding: 10px 12px;\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 10px;\r\n  background: #fff;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__nome {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Il rosso qui e' corretto: e' un avviso, non un accento di marca. */\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__revocato {\r\n  margin-left: 8px;\r\n  padding: 1px 7px;\r\n  border-radius: 999px;\r\n  background: var(--red);\r\n  font-size: 10px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  text-transform: uppercase;\r\n  color: #fff;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__dettagli,\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__pa {\r\n  margin: 2px 0 0;\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ── Modale ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco-modale {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  width: min(720px, 96vw);\r\n  max-height: 88vh;\r\n  max-width: none;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  overflow: hidden;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco-modale__testa {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: flex-start;\r\n  justify-content: space-between;\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n  padding: 18px 20px 12px;\r\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco-modale__testa h2 {\r\n  margin: 0 0 4px;\r\n  font-size: 16px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ── Pagina dedicata ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\r\n\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci {\r\n  max-width: 1400px;\r\n  margin: 0 auto;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci__corpo {\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: var(--card-radius, 14px);\r\n  background: var(--surface);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ── Indicatore sulla riga di terapia ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\r\n\r\n.farmaco-trovato {\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 4px;\r\n  margin: 3px 0 0 6px;\r\n  padding: 2px 6px;\r\n  border-radius: 999px;\r\n  background: var(--emerald-bg);\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n  line-height: 1.4;\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n  vertical-align: middle;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.farmaco-trovato svg {\r\n  display: block;\r\n  width: 12px;\r\n  height: 12px;\r\n  color: var(--teal);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* \"non in anagrafica\" / \"senza documento\": ds-badge--warning canonico (ambra, mai rosso: non è\r\n   un allarme clinico ma un dato mancante su cui l'operatore può agire). */\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__icona {\r\n  flex: none;\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  place-items: center;\r\n  width: 24px;\r\n  height: 24px;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n}\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__icona svg {\r\n  width: 20px;\r\n  height: 20px;\r\n}\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__testo {\r\n  /* Base esplicita: su schermi stretti è il pulsante ad andare a capo, non le parole a spezzarsi. */\r\n  flex: 1 1 200px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  overflow-wrap: break-word;\r\n}\r\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\r\n  .ricerca-farmaco__riga {\r\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  }\r\n  .ricerca-farmaco__riga > :last-child {\r\n    margin-left: 36px;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},"/* Farmaci — HMI 1 (artifacts/hmi-parity/proto/farmaci.png). Solo la pagina: la modale della\r\n   terapia usa lo stesso corpo di ricerca con i suoi stili. */\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci {\r\n  max-width: none;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci__corpo {\r\n  border-radius: 16px;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco {\r\n  padding: 24px;\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__campo {\r\n  height: 48px;\r\n  padding: 0 16px;\r\n  border: 2px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 12px;\r\n  background: #f5f7fb;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__campo input {\r\n  font-size: 16px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__nota {\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  line-height: 20px;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__vuoto {\r\n  padding: 16px 0;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__esiti {\r\n  overflow: visible;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__lista {\r\n  gap: 0;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__riga {\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n  padding: 12px 0;\r\n  border: 0;\r\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 0;\r\n  background: transparent;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__nome {\r\n  font: 600 16px/24px var(--font-ui);\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__dettagli,\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__pa {\r\n  font: 400 14px/20px var(--font-ui);\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\r\n  .page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco {\r\n    padding: 16px;\r\n  }\r\n  .page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__riga {\r\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  }\r\n  .page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__riga > :last-child {\r\n    margin-left: 40px;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"]],[[20,30]],["BODY",{},[[20,31]],["DIV",{"id":"root"},["DIV",{"class":"app-shell"},[[9,2]],["DIV",{"class":"main-area-clean"},[[2,1]],["MAIN",{"class":"page-content content-panel"},["DIV",{"class":"patient-record-view"},["DIV",{"class":"chart-sections no-print"},["NAV",{"class":"top-nav top-nav--level2 top-nav--chips","role":"tablist","aria-label":"Sezioni della cartella"},[[5,12]],["DIV",{"class":"top-nav__items"},["BUTTON",{"type":"button","role":"tab","id":"p